    CWA[(CWA 地震目錄)] -->|Earthquake CSV| A[Import Earthquake Catalog]
    GPS[(GPS 變形)] -->|GPS Data| B[Ingest Precursors]
    MAG[(地磁)] -->|MAG Data| B
    GW[(地下水)] -->|GW Data| B
    TEC[(離電層 TEC)] -->|TEC Data| B
    PRESS[(氣壓)] -->|PRESS Data| B
    RAIN[(雨量)] -->|RAIN Data| B
    TIDAL[(潮汐/水載荷)] -->|TIDAL Data| B
    STRAIN[(地殼應變/應力)] -->|STRAIN Data| B
